    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Five Mics Central",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "A community platform connecting players, cards, decks, and events in one place.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "As Five Mics, a physical trading card game, expanded with new card releases, players gained more ways to build and experiment with their decks, creating a growing need for digital tools and community interaction. I took Five Mics Central from concept to launch, defining its MVP, information architecture, user flows, and interactions before implementing the platform in Plasmic.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "link": "https://central.fivemics.io/",
          "text": "View Site →",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "link": "https://central.fivemics.io/",
          "text": "View Site →",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
