      "blocks": [
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "01",
          "type": "h2",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Problem",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Building a Digital Home for a Growing Community",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "As new booster boxes gave players more cards to build and experiment with, the need for digital tools grew alongside the game. With no dedicated Five Mics platform for players to build, share, or connect, Five Mics Central became an opportunity to support deck building and collection management while creating new ways for the community to discover each other, organize events, and grow together.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": "1209",
          "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/FtG7Yyi6tZUudGm7DAonfSCDg.png?width=2910&height=1209",
          "type": "img",
          "width": "2910"
        }
      ],
      "name": "Problem"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "02",
          "type": "h2",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Product Direction",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "I worked with the founder to shape the initial product vision through rapid AI-assisted prototyping, then studied existing TCG and community platforms to understand how deck building, profiles, events, and collections could work together.",
