        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "What I learned:",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "01 — Fragmented Ecosystems",
          "type": "h4",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Players often rely on separate third-party platforms for deck building, events, rankings, and community activity, leaving no single source of truth for the game ecosystem.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "02 — Powerful, but Hard to Use",
          "type": "h4",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Many existing TCG platforms support deep functionality but come with dense interfaces and steep learning curves, creating an opportunity for clearer hierarchy and more approachable interactions.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "03 — Community as Part of the Product",
          "type": "h4",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Connecting decks, profiles, events, and leaderboards creates more opportunities for players to discover each other, share strategies, and stay engaged beyond individual matches.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        }
      ],
      "name": "Product Direction"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "03",
          "type": "h2",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Define MVP",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "The initial vision extended beyond what we could realistically build for launch. We focused FMC on its core player experiences while partnering with TopDeck.gg for mature event and tournament tools.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "By keeping event data connected across both platforms, players could manage events through TopDeck.gg while surfacing their activity on FMC. Rewards and other engagement features were deferred for future development.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
