          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "With the product structure in place, I translated the core flows into high-fidelity interfaces, balancing the information density of a TCG platform with clear hierarchy and approachable interactions. The experience was designed around connected player activities — building decks, discovering cards and strategies, developing a player identity, and engaging with the wider community.",
