        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "06",
          "type": "h2",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Bringing the Design into Production",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "I implemented the responsive UI in Plasmic and took on front-end work when product needs extended beyond the platform’s native capabilities.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Building Beyond the UI",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "While implementing the Deck Viewer, I used AI-assisted coding to build a dynamic chart that visualizes deck composition at a glance, then integrated it directly into Plasmic.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": "1924",
          "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/4O4sDtml2LyM8ZZVzGzyFc9nHKo.png?scale-down-to=2048&width=3496&height=1924",
          "type": "img",
          "width": "3496"
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "RESPONSIVE IMPLEMENTATION",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Desktop + mobile layouts built in Plasmic",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "DECK ANALYSIS",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Card stats and composition at a glance",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "CUSTOM CODE",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "AI-assisted chart embedded directly into the product",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Turning Extra Cards into a Resale Loop",
          "type": "h1",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": "766",
          "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/fApJDRBECCWlzt4HcR03UEba4.png?scale-down-to=1024&width=1822&height=766",
          "type": "img",
          "width": "1822"
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "While building Collection, I saw an opportunity to turn duplicate cards into a resale loop. I proposed a Sell Cards flow connecting players’ collections to Five Mics’ review process and Shopify storefront.",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": "1724",
          "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/ei2u7e9RzjGNDNcSYBcr4fUjH6U.png?scale-down-to=2048&width=3024&height=1724",
          "type": "img",
          "width": "3024"
        },
        {
          "height": "1724",
          "src": "https://framerusercontent.com/images/plPaZcjaiBfULBlOlzH8KGra6WA.png?scale-down-to=2048&width=3024&height=1724",
          "type": "img",
          "width": "3024"
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "I implemented the front-end state logic to keep multiple selected cards editable, validated, and synchronized throughout the submission flow:",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Select",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Choose cards from Collection",
          "type": "p",
          "width": null
        },
        {
          "height": null,
          "text": "Configure",
